B.cVg=new A.p("raw",B.W,"wikipick-picture-b2-0831: single-row RAW TEXT passthrough \u2014 skip every numeric agg/format entirely and show `valueColumn`'s stored string verbatim off the first row (after `filter`/`scopeRowId`), e.g. a live title string. Fills the one stat mode every other (count/sum/avg/min/max) can't: a bound STRING, not a number. `label` still applies (a static localized caption after the value). Default false = every other stat renders unchanged.",B.f,null)
