B.cUw=new A.p("laneColumn",B.t,"Optional \u2014 group rows sharing this column's value onto ONE lane (one visual row) instead of one row per row, e.g. several bars for the same session. Lanes order by first appearance (earliest start among their rows); overlapping bars within a lane stack onto an extra sub-row rather than overdraw. Each bar keeps its own start/end/status coloring and tap-to-detail. Unset draws one row per row, byte-identical to before this prop existed.",B.f,null)
