B.cTt=new A.p("statusColors",B.V,'Optional {statusValue: colorName} map (colorName one of green/blue/amber/red/grey/purple) overriding the default done/doing/todo bar coloring \u2014 e.g. {"landed":"green","inFlight":"blue","waiting":"amber"}. Absent keeps the original scheme.',B.f,null)
