B.cK0=new A.p("leafAttachmentKinds",B.V,'Child kindColumn values of a LEAF shown as TERMINAL attachment leaves under it (e.g. ["wireframe","docs","image"]): no expand chevron, and a tap opens the item full-screen. Unlike leafChildKinds these never descend \u2014 lets a task\'s attachments appear in the directory tree.',B.f,null)
